invariant: INV-25
file: handshake_post.c
catches: test/lint-exact-fill.sh
reason: handle_ticket opens an rbuf over the message and drops the only
  rb_left call on it, which is the shape lint-exact-fill reports. The
  unit binary objects to this mutant too, because the NewSessionTicket
  boundary pair covers this reader; the lint is what reports the shape in
  a reader whose boundary test nobody has written yet.

--- old
    if (r.err || rb_left(&r) != 0) {
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    if (r.err) {
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
